cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "PARI-GP-ENGINE: a Quarto execution engine and syntax highlighter for PARI/GP"
abstract: >-
  A Quarto engine extension that executes PARI/GP code blocks with the gp
  interpreter, keeping one gp session per document, together with a
  KDE/Skylighting syntax definition for PARI/GP that Quarto applies
  automatically.
type: software
authors:
